# L §4.1 `by n` (tally 2.1.6, issue #87): a month range by 0 is refused at load, LOAD-DOMAIN. tally 2.1.5's
# refcore read it as by 1 and answered 12, as by 1 does.
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

index ms = month 2026-01..2026-12 by 0

ask n: max(pos(k) for k in ms)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-DOMAIN index ms: by 0 is not a positive step (m.tally:7)
